direction.banned:
dark background + centered big text as the default; fade-in/out of everything; bounce easing;
decorative particles/glow/lens flare; uniform linear motion; every element appearing at once;
CSS transitions or @keyframes; timers or requestAnimationFrame in the capture path;
unseeded Math.random; inline easing/duration numbers; all-caps English micro-labels;
a second renderer or a one-off page; a video model for the core picture.
